      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Pressing the key combination \"Ctrl+\\\" in the VRChat application will set you to a grey robot avatar locally, which will allow you to change to a different avatar.\nIf the above option doesn't work or you're unable to load into a world to reset your avatar for any reason, hold down both the Quick Menu buttons for the duration of loading a world and your avatar will be reset upon load-in. If you're using Desktop Mode, you can perform the same step by holding down \\ or ESC key on your keyboard.\nAdditionally: if you're using a VRChat account, you can navigate to the VRChat website, go to the Avatars section, and click the button \"Reset to Default Avatar\". Here's a link: https://vrchat.com/home/avatars",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
