  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Huge avatars (50m+) prevent the use of the avatar and world menus, preventing the user from changing out of the avatar. This can happen due to an uploader's intention, or due to a common error when updating a humanoid rig. There needs to be a way to change avatars once a user finds themselves stuck in a giant avatar.\n\nThere seems to be a limit on the raycast that is used to select items on these menus. The distance measured seems to be from the camera to the menu, or menu center. Sometimes (on some avatars) it is possible to lean very close to the menu, so that your face is right next to it, and then select. If this distance limit was increased or removed the bug would be gone.",
